WEBVTT

00:33:58.590 --> 00:34:02.665
right now at this moment?

00:34:02.665 --> 00:34:06.315
ES: I would say the last year has been a reminder

00:34:06.315 --> 00:34:09.918
that democracy may die behind closed doors,

00:34:09.918 --> 00:34:11.822
but we as individuals are born

00:34:11.822 --> 00:34:14.471
behind those same closed doors,

00:34:14.471 --> 00:34:16.836
and we don't have to give up

00:34:16.836 --> 00:34:20.069
our privacy to have good government.

00:34:20.069 --> 00:34:22.159
We don't have to give up our liberty

00:34:22.159 --> 00:34:23.938
to have security.

00:34:23.938 --> 00:34:26.726
And I think by working together

00:34:26.726 --> 00:34:29.051
we can have both open government

00:34:29.051 --> 00:34:30.988
and private lives,